<section class="page-head"><span class="eyebrow">CONTROL ROOM</span><h1>Admin</h1><p>Manage games and publish manual updates. Automated imports stay separate and traceable.</p></section><?php if($msg):?><div class="alert success"><?=e($msg)?></div><?php endif;?><div class="admin-grid"><form class="panel" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="game"><h2>Add game</h2><label>Name<input name="name" required></label><label>Description<textarea name="description"></textarea></label><label>Image URL<input name="image_url"></label><label>Steam App ID<input name="steam_appid" type="number"></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="featured"> Featured</label><button class="button primary">Add game</button></form><form class="panel" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="update"><h2>Publish update</h2><label>Game<select name="game_id"><?php foreach($games as $g):?><option value="<?=$g['id']?>"><?=e($g['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Title<input name="title" required></label><label>Body<textarea name="body" rows="8"></textarea></label><button class="button primary">Publish</button></form></div><section class="section"><h2>Automation</h2><p>Set a shared-host cron job to call <code>/cron?token=YOUR_TOKEN</code>. It imports Steam News for games with an App ID and ignores already imported items.</p><p class="muted">Payment support is deliberately disabled until configured. Add Stripe credentials to <code>config/config.php</code> and implement the desired checkout/product rules before switching it on.</p></section>